  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification of project contours for involvement of the Netherlands in water, food and biodiversity related activities around the Cienaga Grande de Santa Marta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It is the ambition of the Government of the Netherlands, through the Partners for Water (PVW) programme, to continue the collaboration in the Magdalena department, Colombia.The topic of water and agriculture has been a focus of the Netherlands for years already and as part of the new Partners for Water 5-programme, the focus has shifted to water, food production and biodiversity.The recently approved project &quot;Conservaci&#xf3;n y Uso Sostenible de la Ci&#xe9;naga Grande de Santa Marta en Colombia&quot; provides opportunities to connect previous work and define new project opportunities as part of the bilateral collaboration between Colombia and the Netherlands.The ambition of this assignment is to work with key counterpart organisations and identify concrete activities and deliverables for the future collaboration, financed by the PVW-programme but in direct collaboration with Colombian counterparts.</narrative>
  </description>
